OL,3,GNEWSAHotel asylum use to end after
OL,4,Arevamp approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Surrey hotel will no longer be used
OL,7,Fto house asylum seekers and will return
OL,8,Fto broader public use following a
OL,9,Frefurbishment that has received council
OL,10,Fapproval.
OL,12,FPlans to extend the Stanwell Hotel,
OL,13,Fwhich has been used as asylum
OL,14,Faccommodation by the Home Office since
OL,15,F2022, were approved on Thursday by
OL,16,FSpelthorne Borough Council, paving the
OL,17,Fway for the hotel's revamp.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
