OL,3,GNEWSAHotel asylum use to end after
OL,4,Arevamp approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Local Democracy Reporting Service
OL,7,Fpreviously reported asylum seekers
OL,8,Fstaying at the hotel would be moved to
OL,9,Falternative sites once the #10m project
OL,10,Fstarted.
OL,12,FA Home Office spokesperson said it was
OL,13,F"closing every asylum hotel" but did
OL,14,Fnot say when the Stanwell Hotel asylum
OL,15,Faccommodation would close.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
